	(text_box "@{\"Id\":\"YOJKQEG~{J}XIYARMMV\",\"ObjectType\":2} is a custom 3-pad 0201 resistor footprint. Resistor can be soldered in either direction without leaving a stub on the other path. Can also be used as an inductor for antenna matching along with @{\"Id\":\"YOJKQEG~{J}PHQFPURV\",\"ObjectType\":2} and @{\"Id\":\"YOJKQEG~{J}COBSNRKA\",\"ObjectType\":2}"
